WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:06.306
♪

00:00:06.307 --> 00:00:07.551
&gt;&gt; WE’VE ALWAYS SAID THAT IF AN

00:00:07.586 --> 00:00:09.200
ELDER OR SENIOR IS IN LINE,

00:00:09.202 --> 00:00:10.608
WE’RE GOING TO MOVE THEM TO THE

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:11.862
FRONT OF THE LINE.

00:00:11.863 --> 00:00:13.269
BARRING THAT, ANYONE WHO SIGNS

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:15.329
UP WHETHER YOU WORK IN ALASKA

00:00:15.363 --> 00:00:17.261
AND IF YOU PLAN ON WORKING IN

00:00:17.262 --> 00:00:18.374
ALASKA, YOU CAN GET A

00:00:18.408 --> 00:00:18.768
VACCINATION.

00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:20.407
WE’RE URGING AS MANY FOLKS AS

00:00:20.409 --> 00:00:21.807
POSSIBLE TO DO THIS.

00:00:21.808 --> 00:00:24.821
WE BELIEVE, NEIL, WE’RE GOING TO

00:00:24.822 --> 00:00:27.041
BE ACHIEVING HERD IMMUNITY

00:00:27.042 --> 00:00:28.742
PROBABLY BEFORE ANY OTHER STATE.

00:00:28.743 --> 00:00:30.499
NEIL: BY FAR THE BIGGEST STATE

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:31.916
IN THE COUNTRY, NOW ALASKA

00:00:31.917 --> 00:00:34.151
STANDS OUT FOR HAVING THE MOST

00:00:34.152 --> 00:00:35.514
OPEN VACCINE POLICY OF ANY OTHER

00:00:35.516 --> 00:00:36.626
STATE IN THE COUNTRY.

00:00:36.627 --> 00:00:38.672
YOU CAN BE AS YOUNG WITH AS 16,

00:00:38.673 --> 00:00:40.741
AND THEY’RE READY TO BOOGIE WHEN

00:00:40.742 --> 00:00:42.866
IT COMES TO GIVING YOU THE

00:00:42.867 --> 00:00:44.487
VACCINES.

00:00:44.488 --> 00:00:48.781
MIKE DUN LEVY RAISED THE POINT

00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:50.881
WHERE THE RANGING WAIT TIMES

00:00:50.916 --> 00:00:53.463
WITH PEOPLE WHO JUST WANT TO GET

00:00:53.464 --> 00:00:55.302
THAT VACCINE SEEMED A LITTLE BIT

00:00:55.303 --> 00:00:55.961
SILLY.

00:00:55.995 --> 00:00:58.894
MIKE PARSONS, THE GOVERNOR OF

00:00:58.928 --> 00:01:00.750
MISSOURI, IS DEALING WITH THESE

00:01:00.751 --> 00:01:02.114
ISSUES OF THE VACCINES AND

00:01:02.115 --> 00:01:03.531
GETTING EVERYONE WHAT THEY NEED

00:01:03.532 --> 00:01:04.798
WHEN THEY NEED IT.

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:07.411
HE’S KIND ENOUGH TO JOIN US ON A

00:01:07.412 --> 00:01:08.290
SATURDAY FROM SPRINGFIELD.

00:01:08.325 --> 00:01:09.409
GOVERNOR, VERY GOOD TO SEE YOU

00:01:09.411 --> 00:01:09.821
AGAIN.

00:01:09.855 --> 00:01:10.900
HOW YOU DOING?

00:01:10.901 --> 00:01:12.905
&gt;&gt; I’M DOING GOOD, NEIL.

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:15.121
GOOD TO SEE YOU THIS MORNING.

00:01:15.123 --> 00:01:15.766
NEIL: SAME HERE.

00:01:15.767 --> 00:01:17.663
LET’S TALK A LITTLE BIT ABOUT

00:01:17.664 --> 00:01:19.001
WHAT YOUR VACCINE KIND OF RULES

00:01:19.003 --> 00:01:19.285
ARE.

00:01:19.286 --> 00:01:21.117
WHO GETS TO THE FRONT OF THE

00:01:21.151 --> 00:01:22.692
LINE, HOW BIG IS THAT LINE?

00:01:22.693 --> 00:01:23.432
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

00:01:23.433 --> 00:01:24.182
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:01:24.183 --> 00:01:26.048
YOU KNOW, THE MAIN PRIORITY

00:01:26.082 --> 00:01:29.288
WE’VE HAD IS THE SAME PLAN WE

00:01:29.289 --> 00:01:31.780
SET IN OCTOBER, THE CDC, AND WE

00:01:31.782 --> 00:01:33.336
ARE ABSOLUTELY EXECUTING THAT

00:01:33.371 --> 00:01:35.073
PLAN JUST LIKE IT WAS ORIGINALLY

00:01:35.107 --> 00:01:36.814
PUT TOGETHER AND MAKING SURE

00:01:36.816 --> 00:01:38.216
WE’RE NOT DOING KNEE-JERK

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:39.316
REACTIONS TO EVERYBODY WANTING

00:01:39.351 --> 00:01:41.167
TO JUMP THE LINE.

00:01:41.168 --> 00:01:43.337
OUR BIGGEST PRIORITY IS PEOPLE

00:01:43.338 --> 00:01:44.838
65 YEARS AND OLDER, THE MOST

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:46.940
VULNERABLE POPULATION IN OUR

00:01:46.975 --> 00:01:48.788
STATE, AND WE STAYED FOCUSED ON

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:49.453
THAT.

00:01:49.488 --> 00:01:52.541
NEXT WEEK WE’LL GO TO THE NEXT

00:01:52.543 --> 00:01:53.640
LEVEL, BUT THAT’S, FRANKLY,

00:01:53.675 --> 00:01:54.896
SEVERAL WEEKS AHEAD OF IT.

00:01:54.897 --> 00:01:56.158
AND RIGHT NOW WE’RE SECOND IN

00:01:56.193 --> 00:01:57.354
THE UNITED STATES WITH THE

00:01:57.388 --> 00:01:58.231
LOWEST POSITIVITY RATE IN THE

00:01:58.266 --> 00:01:58.687
COUNTRY.

00:01:58.688 --> 00:02:00.419
AND WHEN YOU HAVE THAT GOING

00:02:00.454 --> 00:02:01.880
BECAUSE OF THINGS WE’VE DONE,

00:02:01.881 --> 00:02:03.532
AND WE NEVER SHUT OUR STATE

00:02:03.533 --> 00:02:04.780
DOWN, WE NEVER SHUT DOWN THE

00:02:04.815 --> 00:02:05.921
STATE OF MISSOURI.

00:02:05.922 --> 00:02:07.527
WE NEVER DID THE MANDATES FROM

00:02:07.528 --> 00:02:08.645
THE GOVERNOR’S OFFICE.

00:02:08.646 --> 00:02:10.061
SO I THINK A COMBINATION OF

00:02:10.095 --> 00:02:11.731
STAYING WITH THE VACCINE PLAN

00:02:11.765 --> 00:02:13.984
AND MAKING SURE WE GET THAT DONE

00:02:13.985 --> 00:02:15.631
AND HAVING THE NATIONAL GUARD --

00:02:15.665 --> 00:02:17.425
I CAN’T SAY ENOUGH FOR THEIR

00:02:17.426 --> 00:02:18.468
SUPPORT -- DOING MASS VACCINE

00:02:18.469 --> 00:02:19.062
OPERATIONS.

00:02:19.096 --> 00:02:21.256
AND WE WILL BE DOING A

00:02:21.257 --> 00:02:22.670
MEGA-VACCINE OPERATION NEXT WEEK

00:02:22.671 --> 00:02:24.009
IN KANSAS CITY, MISSOURI.

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:25.286
SO THERE’S NOT ENOUGH VACCINE.

00:02:25.321 --> 00:02:26.207
WE UNDERSTAND THAT.

00:02:26.242 --> 00:02:26.934
EVERYBODY DOES.

00:02:26.936 --> 00:02:29.129
BUT, I MEAN, IT’S ALL HANDS ON

00:02:29.164 --> 00:02:31.499
DECK RIGHT NOW, AND WE’RE PUDDLE

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:33.225
NEEDLES IN PEOPLE’S -- PUTTING

00:02:33.227 --> 00:02:34.974
NEEDLES IN PEOPLE’S ARMS THAT

00:02:35.008 --> 00:02:35.867
WANT IT.

00:02:35.868 --> 00:02:37.567
NEIL: THE PRIME MINISTER HAS A

00:02:37.569 --> 00:02:39.282
GOAL OF -- THE PRESIDENT HAS A

00:02:39.283 --> 00:02:41.291
GOAL OF GETTING EVERYONE THAT

00:02:41.292 --> 00:02:42.650
WANTS TO BE VACCINATED BY MAY

00:02:42.652 --> 00:02:43.017
1ST.

00:02:43.018 --> 00:02:44.649
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, I THINK WE’LL GET

00:02:44.651 --> 00:02:45.425
CLOSE TO THAT.

00:02:45.426 --> 00:02:47.332
I DON’T KNOW THAT YOU’RE GOING

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:48.779
TO GET IT ALL DONE BY MAY THE

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:49.434
1ST.

00:02:49.436 --> 00:02:51.127
I THINK THAT’S A PREDICTION,

00:02:51.128 --> 00:02:52.763
WISHFUL THINKING, IT’S GOING TO

00:02:52.764 --> 00:02:54.553
TAKE US A WHILE TO GET EVERYBODY

00:02:54.555 --> 00:02:55.217
VACCINATE LDED.

00:02:55.218 --> 00:02:57.842
I THINK THE MAIN THING IS YOU

00:02:57.843 --> 00:02:58.967
GET THE HIGH RISK CATEGORIES

00:02:58.969 --> 00:02:59.210
DONE.

00:02:59.245 --> 00:03:01.059
I DO THINK WE CAN GET THAT DONE

00:03:01.093 --> 00:03:02.640
BY THE FIRST PART OF MAY, AND I

00:03:02.642 --> 00:03:04.538
THINK YOU’RE GOING TO SEE IN THE

00:03:04.539 --> 00:03:06.343
NEXT 60 DAYS WHERE PEOPLE CAN GO

00:03:06.345 --> 00:03:07.390
TO PHARMACY, THE HEALTH CARE

00:03:07.425 --> 00:03:09.143
CLINICS AND PROBABLY GET

00:03:09.178 --> 00:03:10.967
VACCINES ON ON THEIR OWN THAN

00:03:11.001 --> 00:03:13.008
HAVING TO DEPEND ON STATE

00:03:13.009 --> 00:03:14.467
GOVERNMENTS TO RUN THOSE PLANS.

00:03:14.501 --> 00:03:16.748
NEIL: GOVERNOR, WHAT IS YOUR

00:03:16.782 --> 00:03:18.408
POLICY ON MASKS?

00:03:18.442 --> 00:03:20.251
&gt;&gt; I’M SORRY, NEIL, WHAT WAS

00:03:20.252 --> 00:03:20.631
THAT?

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:22.529
NEIL: I’M SORRY.

00:03:22.564 --> 00:03:24.326
WHAT’S YOUR POLICY ON MASKS,

00:03:24.361 --> 00:03:24.980
GOVERNOR?

00:03:25.014 --> 00:03:27.252
&gt;&gt; WELL, YOU KNOW, THE NEXT

00:03:27.286 --> 00:03:29.720
THING WE’RE GOING TO BE DOING AS

00:03:29.722 --> 00:03:33.005
WE MOVE FORWARD IS TO GO TO SOME

00:03:33.039 --> 00:03:35.169
OF THE MEGA VACCINES AND THEN

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:37.092
ALSO WE’LL TAKE THAT NEXT STAGE

00:03:37.093 --> 00:03:38.942
OF PEOPLE THAT COMES IN, AND

00:03:38.976 --> 00:03:40.448
WE’LL BE IN WHAT WE CALL PHASE

00:03:40.482 --> 00:03:40.875
THREE.

00:03:40.876 --> 00:03:42.534
AND PHASE THREE WE’LL GET PRETTY

00:03:42.568 --> 00:03:43.847
CLOSE TO THE ENTIRE GENERAL

00:03:43.848 --> 00:03:45.265
PUBLIC THAT’S OUT THERE.

00:03:45.266 --> 00:03:46.913
SO, AGAIN, WE’RE ABOUT TWO WEEKS

00:03:46.914 --> 00:03:47.951
AHEAD OF EVERYTHING WE’VE

00:03:47.952 --> 00:03:49.602
PREDICTED SO FAR AT THIS POINT.

00:03:49.603 --> 00:03:51.956
SO WE JUST KEEP MOVING THAT TO

00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:53.199
THE NEXT LEVEL.

00:03:53.234 --> 00:03:54.448
NEIL: GOVERNOR, THANK YOU VERY

00:03:54.449 --> 00:03:54.917
MUCH.

00:03:54.951 --> 00:03:56.420
VERY LITTLE FANFARE.

00:03:56.421 --> 00:03:58.101
YOU’VE JUST BEEN VERY DILIGENT

00:03:58.135 --> 00:04:00.011
THROUGHOUT THIS PROCESS, AND IT

00:04:00.046 --> 00:04:01.303
SEEM TO BE WORKING.

00:04:01.337 --> 00:04:02.244
MIKE PARSON, GOVERNOR OF THE

